{"resourceIdentifier":"4173","resourceName":"Akalan Biogas Energy Power Plant","description":"Akalan Biogas Power Plant, built and operated in Denizli Province, Acıpayam Distrcit, Akalan Village has an installed capacity of 3.12 MWe/ 3.150 MWm. as per the generation licence, numbered EÜ/10274-1/04999. The purpose of the project activity is to produce electricity from poultry and cattle manure with biomethanization process which will also result in fermented products that could be utilized as fertilizers by local farmers. Akalan Biogas Power plant has been granted the generation license from EMRA on 24/06/2021. As per the generation license, the annual expected generation is 23,400 MWh/year.\r\n\r\nThe facility is planned to consist of 2 co-generation units. The first unit was commissioned on 30/06/2021, each with an installed capacity of 1.560 MWe. Accordingly, project activity start date is 30/06/2021. The remaining unit with an installed capacity of 1.560 MWe was commissioned on 09/09/2022.The facility is expected to generate 23,400 MWh/year when operational capacity is 3.12 MWe. It is estimated that the project will help reduce carbon emissions by 118,249 tons annually. The total emission reduction for the whole crediting period is calculated as 1.182.494 tCO2e.","location":{"latitude":37.363021,"longitude":29.385240},"inPublicCommentPeriod":false,"lastPublicCommentPeriod":{"startInclusive":"2023-04-04","endExclusive":"2023-05-05","endInclusive":"2023-05-04"},"attributes":[{"code":"PROJECT_ID","values":[{"type":"string","value":"4173"}]}],"participationSummaries":[{"programCode":"VCS","attributes":[{"code":"PROPONENT_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Multiple Proponents"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_STATUS","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Registered"}]},{"code":"EST_ANNUAL_EMISSION_REDCT","values":[{"type":"string","value":"81924"}]},{"code":"PRIMARY_PROJECT_CATEGORY_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Energy industries (renewable/non-renewable sources)"}]},{"code":"PROTOCOL_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"AM0073"}]},{"code":"VALIDATOR_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Earthood Services Limited"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_REGISTRATION_DATE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"24/03/2025"}]},{"code":"CREDIT_PERIOD_INFO","values":[{"type":"string","value":"1st, 30/06/2021 - 29/06/2028"}]}]}],"documentGroups":[{"code":"VCS_PIPELINE_DOCUMENTS","description":"VCS Pipeline Documents","documents":[{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=85249&IDKEY=wlksjoiuwqowrnoiuomnckjashoufifmln902309ksdflku0980117558371","documentType":"Draft Project Description","documentName":"VCS_PROJ_DESC_DRAFT_4173_10FEB2023.pdf","uploadDate":"2023-02-24T15:26:31.81Z"},{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=87811&IDKEY=a903q4jsafkasjfu90amnmasdfkaidflnmdf9348r09dmfasdf3121091369","documentType":"Draft Project Description","documentName":"VCS_PROJ_DESC_PCP_4173_04APR2023.pdf","uploadDate":"2023-04-04T19:52:20.817Z"},{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=84501&IDKEY=slksjoiuwqowrnoiuomnckjashoufifmln902309ksdflku098h116526879","documentType":"Listing Representation","documentName":"Akalan listing.pdf","uploadDate":"2023-02-10T17:12:51.637Z"},{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=86594&IDKEY=j8723kjnf7kjandsaslmdv09887vaksmrmnwqkjoiuanfnfuq0j119413126","documentType":"Listing Representation","documentName":"Akalan listing.pdf","uploadDate":"2023-03-17T07:46:34.233Z"}]},{"code":"VCS_REGISTRATION_DOCUMENTS","description":"VCS Registration Documents","documents":[{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=129432&IDKEY=9097809fdslkjf09rndasfufd098asodfjlkduf09nm23mrn87f178486728","documentType":"Project Description","documentName":"4173_PD_CL_V10.pdf","uploadDate":"2025-03-24T15:41:11.13Z"},{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mym